⚠️ *Weekly Churn Risk Report*

*Summary:*
• Total Customers: {{ $json.summary.total_customers }}
• At Risk: {{ $json.summary.at_risk }} ({{ $json.summary.high_risk }} high, {{ $json.summary.medium_risk }} medium)
• Revenue at Risk: Rp {{ Number($json.summary.revenue_at_risk).toLocaleString('id-ID') }}

🚨 *High Risk Customers:*
{{ $json.at_risk_customers.filter(c => c.risk_level === 'high').slice(0, 5).map((c, i) => `${i+1}. *${c.name}* (${c.company}) — Risk: ${c.churn_risk}%\n   Value: Rp ${Number(c.deal_value).toLocaleString('id-ID')}\n   Signals: ${c.signals.join(', ')}\n   Action: ${c.recommended_action}`).join('\n\n') || 'None' }}

⚠️ *Medium Risk:*
{{ $json.at_risk_customers.filter(c => c.risk_level === 'medium').slice(0, 5).map((c, i) => `${i+1}. ${c.name} (${c.company}) — Risk: ${c.churn_risk}% | ${c.signals[0]}`).join('\n') || 'None' }}
